Consumer: STK-005 - Valuation Operations and STK-006 - Fund Accounting and NAV Operations.
 
Content: Active and historical trade positions, accepted trade versions, applied valuation dates and amounts, accounting-position state, processing reference, and resulting accounting information.
 
Purpose: Provides the authoritative FAP state used for valuation-population comparison, applied-state confirmation, and accounting-impact review.]]></documentation>
