      <manualTask name="Review unrealised P&amp;L and derivative accounting impact"
                   id="_081d2ab4-f925-4364-ba22-0a55f664b9d2"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_081d2ab4-f925-4364-ba22-0a55f664b9d2"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-006; CSP-AC-001-002; CSP-PP-005; CSP-VQ-004.
 
Input: Applied valuations, resulting accounting information, operational control evidence, and any open valuation exceptions.
 
Handling: Review the resulting unrealised P&L and derivative asset or liability impact for unexpected signs, classifications, movements, or missing accounting effects before the applicable NAV cut-off. Assess whether a controlled adjustment, monitored exception, or escalation is required. Internal NAV calculation and publication remain outside scope.
 
Output: Accepted accounting and NAV impact, controlled adjustment requirement, or escalated material exception.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <adonis:instance>
               <adonis:attribute name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES"
                                  type="ENUM"
                                  notebook="1"
                                  sourcelang=""
