      <userTask name="Upload the valuation file to SYS-FAP"
                 id="_0ccd111d-e021-4dae-8030-bb801f628fd0"
                 isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_0ccd111d-e021-4dae-8030-bb801f628fd0"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-004; CSP-PP-002.
 
Input: Controlled valuation records prepared in the approved FAP valuation structure.
 
Handling: Assemble and upload the controlled valuation file through the current SYS-FAP user interface or established operational workflow. Retain the available submission reference and timestamp.
 
Output: Submitted valuation file available for SYS-FAP validation and processing.]]></documentation>
