      <manualTask name="Coordinate corrected or replacement valuation data"
                   id="_1a752b8f-8edd-44ce-b0c3-cf6b840acc1c"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_1a752b8f-8edd-44ce-b0c3-cf6b840acc1c"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CPS-VL-002-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-VQ-004.
 
Input: Confirmed file-level or valuation-population exception requiring corrected or replacement data.
 
Handling: Coordinate source clarification and obtain corrected or replacement valuation data where available. Confirm the relevant trade identifiers, versions, valuation date, expected population and timeliness before returning the data for complete revalidation. Prior-day valuations are not reused automatically.
 
Output: Corrected or replacement valuation data readu for complete population revalidation, or confirmation that the exception remains unresolved before the applicable NAV cut-off.]]></documentation>
