         <documentation id="documentation_24998adb-9bec-4e05-b5f3-fee4ffc50311"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-006; CSP-AC-001-002; CSP-PP-005.
 
Select Yes when the applied valuation population and resulting accounting impact have been reviewed and no unresolved material exception prevents local daily valuation completion.
 
Select No when an incorrect, incomplete, or unexplained accounting impact requires controlled adjustment, further investigation, monitoring or escalation.]]></documentation>
