      <manualTask name="Confirm file-level controls and compare the valuation population"
                   id="_2e2dca4c-02e8-4d4d-9acb-9d3b32726b8f"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_2e2dca4c-02e8-4d4d-9acb-9d3b32726b8f"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-002; SCN-005; CSP-VQ-004.
 
Input: Scheduled daily valuation file, current SYS-FAP accounting-position population, and operational lifecycle tracker.
 
Handling: Confirm file availability, valuation date, source timestamp, structure, available control information, and timeliness. Compare the received valuation population with positions expected to be active according to SYS-FAP and the operational lifecycle tracker.
 
Output: Processable valuation file with population-comparison results, or a file-level exception that prevents normal record-level processing.]]></documentation>
