      <inclusiveGateway name="Which reconciled valuation outcomes were identified?"
                         id="_46543990-f8d7-4a9b-b5ed-2e75c26a6e63">
         <documentation id="documentation_46543990-f8d7-4a9b-b5ed-2e75c26a6e63"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-005; CSP-SM-007.
 
Activate Accepted and applied valuations when one or more submitted records were accepted and their resulting SYS-FAP state was confirmed.
 
Activate Processing exceptions when one or more records were rejected, missing from the results, duplicated, unexplained, or not applied as expected.
 
Activate both paths when successful and unsuccessful record outcomes coexist within the same submission.]]></documentation>
