      <inclusiveGateway name="Which valuation populations were identified?"
                         id="_4bb19128-aee7-4af1-b645-6bde3e04b114">
         <documentation id="documentation_4bb19128-aee7-4af1-b645-6bde3e04b114"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-003; SCN-005.
 
Activate Accepted valuations when one or more valuation records are suitable for normal processing.
 
Activate Valuation exceptions when one or more missing, stale, duplicate, rejected, unknown-trade, or historical-version valuations require investigation.
 
Activate both paths when accepted records and valuation exceptions coexist within the same daily population.]]></documentation>
