      <manualTask name="Reconcile processing results and confirm the applied state"
                   id="_9dcce6e1-3d67-471c-babc-14b50a3c7104"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_9dcce6e1-3d67-471c-babc-14b50a3c7104"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-005; CSP-PP-006; CSP-SM-006-007.
 
Input: Submitted FAP valuation file, FAP valuation processing results, and current SYS-FAP accounting-position state.
 
Handling: Reconcile the submitted and processed populations using available file, batch, record, trade, version, and valuation-date identifiers. Confirm that accepted valuations were applied to the expected positions and identify rejected, missing, duplicated, or unexplained outcomes.
 
Output: Confirmed applied valuation population and separately identified FAP-processing exceptions. A successful file result alone is not treated as sufficient evidence of the resulting applied state.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <adonis:instance>
               <adonis:attribute name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES"
