      <manualTask name="Transform and control accepted valuations"
                   id="_abfec91b-1953-477e-ba18-8f7a918ed22b"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_abfec91b-1953-477e-ba18-8f7a918ed22b"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-004; CSP-PP-002.
 
Input: Accepted valuation records and the approved FAP valuation template.
 
Handling: Preserve the source trade and version identifiers, map the valuation information into the required FAP structure, apply the required formats and permitted values, and perform local record-count and control-total checks.
 
Output: Controlled valuation records ready for FAP import-file preparation and upload.]]></documentation>
