      <manualTask name="Assess materiality and required NAV treatment"
                   id="_b81b5ee5-12cb-4584-afeb-28d6bc58666d"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_b81b5ee5-12cb-4584-afeb-28d6bc58666d"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-PR-008; CSP-VL-006; CSP-RC-006; CSP-VQ-010.
 
Input: Unresolved valuation exception, affected population, supporting evidence and applicable cut-off information.
 
Handling: Assess the materiality and potential effect on valuation, accounting and NAV controls. Determine the required monitoring, controlled treatment or escalation under the applicable procedures. No automatic reuse of a prior-day valuation or unapproved estimate is assumed.
 
Output:  Documented accounting and NAV treatement, responsible owner and required follow-up for the unresolved valuation exception.]]></documentation>
