      <manualTask name="Document and escalate the unresolved valuation excepion"
                   id="_f38db1ab-17ea-45ad-a902-cf127c3bfdc4"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_f38db1ab-17ea-45ad-a902-cf127c3bfdc4"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Input: Valuation exception for which corrected or replacement data is unavailable before the applicable NAV cut-off.
 
Handling: Record the affected population, exception classification, current status, assigned owner, supporting evidence, cut-off impact and required next action. Update the operational lifecycle tracker and notify Fund Accounting and NAV Operations and any other required exception owner.
 
Output: Updated operational status, valuation exception record, investigation evidence and escalation for accounting and NAV assessment.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <adonis:instance>
               <adonis:attribute name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES"
